   C++ tools for solving the Linear Sum Assignment Problem with Edition (LSAPE)
               and the Linear Sum Assignment Problem (LSAP)

             ( https://bougleux.users.greyc.fr/lsape/ )

                            version 1, May 2016
                            version 4, July 2017

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Summary
#---------

  LSAPE is a set of open-source C++ and matlab functions for computing solutions to 
  - linear sum assignment problem (LSAP)
  - linear sum assignment problem with error-correction (LSAPE), and 
  with
  - Hungarian algorithms
  - Greedy algorithms

